{"id":"6389fb4ec3d1a51d187e621df4dceecf5ca17c99","url":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1000116/google-gemini-business-phone-calls","title":"Gemini can now call businesses for you so you don’t have to wait on hold","site_name":"TechURLs","source":"The Verge","byline":"Stevie Bonifield","excerpt":"A new Gemini feature rolling out as a preview on Pixel 11 phones allows users to have Google’s AI call local businesses on their behalf.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"__next\"><p><a href=\"#content\"><span>Skip to main content</span></a></p><nav id=\"sticky-nav\" aria-label=\"Sticky Nav\"></nav><div><main id=\"content\"><div><article><div><div><p>﻿Google’s AI can handle entire phone calls with businesses with a new Pixel 11 feature.</p></div><div><div><p>﻿Google’s AI can handle entire phone calls with businesses with a new Pixel 11 feature.</p><div><p><span><span>by</span> <!-- --> <span aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span id=\"follow-author-author_byline_lead-dmcyOmF1dGhvclByb2ZpbGU6ODAzMzIw\"><span><span><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 9 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Follow\"><path d=\"M5 0H4V4H0V5H4V9H5V5H9V4H5V0Z\" /></svg></span></span><span>Stevie Bonifield</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><time dateTime=\"2026-09-24T16:04:31+00:00\">Sep 24, 2026, 4:04 PM UTC</time></span></p></div></div><div><div><p><img alt=\"Google Pixel 11 Pro Photos of Phone Using On Ear\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 700px\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&str