el-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=2400 2400w\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=2400\"></p></div><p><cite>Photo: David Imel / The Verge</cite></p></div></div></div><div><div><div><p><a href=\"/authors/stevie-bonifield\"><img alt=\"Stevie Bonifield\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/10/STEVIE_BONIFIELD_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&w=48 1x, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/10/STEVIE_BONIFIELD_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&w=96 2x\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/10/STEVIE_BONIFIELD_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&w=96\"></a></p><div><p><span aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span id=\"follow-author-standard_article_details-dmcyOmF1dGhvclByb2ZpbGU6ODAzMzIw\"><span><span><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 9 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Follow\"><path d=\"M5 0H4V4H0V5H4V9H5V5H9V4H5V0Z\" /></svg></span></span><span>Stevie Bonifield</span></span></span></p> <p><span>is a news writer covering all things consumer tech. Stevie started out at Laptop Mag writing news and reviews on hardware, gaming, and AI.</span></p></div></div><div id=\"zephr-anchor\"><p>Google’s launching an “early experiment” feature on Pixel 11 that lets users delegate local business calls to Gemini, like making a reservation, checking if a product is in stock, or rescheduling an appointment. According to Google, you don’t even need to start the call to have Gemini handle it for you:</p><div><blockquote><p>Instead of dialing yourself, just tell Gemini to call on your behalf using the Gemini app on your Pixel. Gemini will call the business, introduce itself, navigate automated phone menus, wait on hold, and handle the conversation with the person on the other end. You remain in control at all times with a live transcript view and the ability to take over the conversation at any point.</p></blockquote></div><div><div><p><a href=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,2.7871503450776,100,66.770266770267\" data-pswp-height=\"859.3333333333334\" data-pswp-width=\"1289\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"A screenshot of Google Gemini having a phone call with a business\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 639px) 100vw, (max-width: 1023px) 50vw, 700px\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=256 256w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=2400 2400w\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-24-at-12.06.43-PM.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C2.7871503450776%2C100%2C66.770266770267&w=2400\"></a></p></div><p><cite>Image: Google</cite></p></div><p>Google announced a similar <a href=\"/ai-artificial-intelligence/830450/ai-shopping-assistants-are-stuck-in-the-past\">“Call for me” feature</a> last year that has its AI call local businesses to ask if they have a product you’re looking for, but it didn’t have an option for users to take over those phone calls. Meta is also working on a similar automated phone call feature for its <a href=\"/ai-artificial-intelligence/999526/meta-muse-ai-agent-hands-on-shopping\">Muse AI agent</a>, although those calls <a href=\"https://www.404media.co/meta-tests-muse-ai-agent-calls-that-are-actually-made-by-humans-in-a-call-center/\">reportedly</a> might be made by a human behind the scenes. Google’s new AI calling feature is rolling out starting today as an “early preview” for “Gemini paid subscribers enrolled in the Phone by Google Public Beta on Pixel 11 in the US.”</p><div><p><span><strong>Follow topics and authors</strong> from this story to see more like this in your personalized homepage feed and to receive email updates.</span></p><ul><li id=\"follow-author-article_footer-dmcyOmF1dGhvclByb2ZpbGU6ODAzMzIw\"><span aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span><span><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 9 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Follow\"><path d=\"M5 0H4V4H0V5H4V9H5V5H9V4H5V0Z\" /></svg></span><span>Stevie Bonifield</span></span></span></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></div></div></div><!--$--><div><form><div><div><h2>The Verge Daily</h2><p><span>A free daily digest of the news that matters most.</span></p></div><div><fieldset><div><p><label for=\"email\">Email (required)</label></p></div></fieldset></div></div></form></div><!--/$--></div></article><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main></div></div></DIV>","content_text":"Skip to main content Google’s AI can handle entire phone calls with businesses with a new Pixel 11 feature. Google’s AI can handle entire phone calls with businesses with a new Pixel 11 feature.by Stevie BonifieldSep 24, 2026, 4:04 PM UTCPhoto: David Imel / The VergeStevie Bonifield is a news writer covering all things consumer tech. Stevie started out at Laptop Mag writing news and reviews on hardware, gaming, and AI.Google’s launching an “early experiment” feature on Pixel 11 that lets users delegate local business calls to Gemini, like making a reservation, checking if a product is in stock, or rescheduling an appointment. According to Google, you don’t even need to start the call to have Gemini handle it for you:Instead of dialing yourself, just tell Gemini to call on your behalf using the Gemini app on your Pixel. Gemini will call the business, introduce itself, navigate automated phone menus, wait on hold, and handle the conversation with the person on the other end. You remain in control at all times with a live transcript view and the ability to take over the conversation at any point.Image: GoogleGoogle announced a similar “Call for me” feature last year that has its AI call local businesses to ask if they have a product you’re looking for, but it didn’t have an option for users to take over those phone calls. Meta is also working on a similar automated phone call feature for its Muse AI agent, although those calls reportedly might be made by a human behind the scenes. Google’s new AI calling feature is rolling out starting today as an “early preview” for “Gemini paid subscribers enrolled in the Phone by Google Public Beta on Pixel 11 in the US.”Follow topics and authors from this story to see more like this in your personalized homepage feed and to receive email updates.Stevie BonifieldThe Verge DailyA free daily digest of the news that matters most.Email (required)","fetched_at":"2026-09-25T22:28:09.378Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p><a href=\"#content\"><span>Skip to main content</span></a></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Skip to main content","zh":"跳至主要内容"}]},{"html_en":"<p>﻿Google’s AI can handle entire phone calls with businesses with a new Pixel 11 feature.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Google’s AI can handle entire phone calls with businesses with a new Pixel 11 feature.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>﻿Google’s AI can handle entire phone calls with businesses with a new Pixel 11 feature.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Google’s AI can handle entire phone calls with businesses with a new Pixel 11 feature.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span><span>by</span> <!-- --> <span aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span id=\"follow-author-author_byline_lead-dmcyOmF1dGhvclByb2ZpbGU6ODAzMzIw\"><span><span><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 9 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Follow\"><path d=\"M5 0H4V4H0V5H4V9H5V5H9V4H5V0Z\" /></svg></span></span><span>Stevie Bonifield</span></span></span></span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"by Stevie Bonifield","zh":"作者：史蒂维·博尼菲尔德"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span><time dateTime=\"2026-09-24T16:04:31+00:00\">Sep 24, 2026, 4:04 PM UTC</time></span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Sep 24, 2026, 4:04 PM UTC","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><cite>Photo: David Imel / The Verge</cite></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Photo: David Imel / The Verge","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span id=\"follow-author-standard_article_details-dmcyOmF1dGhvclByb2ZpbGU6ODAzMzIw\"><span><span><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 9 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Follow\"><path d=\"M5 0H4V4H0V5H4V9H5V5H9V4H5V0Z\" /></svg></span></span><span>Stevie Bonifield</span></span></span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Stevie Bonifield","zh":"史蒂维·博尼菲尔德"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>is a news writer covering all things consumer tech. Stevie started out at Laptop Mag writing news and reviews on hardware, gaming, and AI.</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"is a news writer covering all things consumer tech.","zh":"是一位涵盖消费科技所有领域的新闻撰稿人。"},{"en":"Stevie started out at Laptop Mag writing news and reviews on hardware, gaming, and AI.","zh":"Stevie 最初在 Laptop Mag 撰写有关硬件、游戏和人工智能的新闻和评论。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Google’s launching an “early experiment” feature on Pixel 11 that lets users delegate local business calls to Gemini, like making a reservation, checking if a product is in stock, or rescheduling an appointment. According to Google, you don’t even need to start the call to have Gemini handle it for you:</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Google’s launching an “early experiment” feature on Pixel 11 that lets users delegate local business calls to Gemini, like making a reservation, checking if a product is in stock, or rescheduling an appointment.","zh":null},{"en":"According to Google, you don’t even need to start the call to have Gemini handle it for you:","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<blockquote><p>Instead of dialing yourself, just tell Gemini to call on your behalf using the Gemini app on your Pixel. Gemini will call the business, introduce itself, navigate automated phone menus, wait on hold, and handle the conversation with the person on the other end. You remain in control at all times with a live transcript view and the ability to take over the conversation at any point.</p></blockquote>","sentences":[{"en":"Instead of dialing yourself, just tell Gemini to call on your behalf using the Gemini app on your Pixel.","zh":null},{"en":"Gemini will call the business, introduce itself, navigate automated phone menus, wait on hold, and handle the conversation with the person on the other end.","zh":null},{"en":"You remain in control at all times with a live transcript view and the ability to take over the conversation at any point.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Instead of dialing yourself, just tell Gemini to call on your behalf using the Gemini app on your Pixel. Gemini will call the business, introduce itself, navigate automated phone menus, wait on hold, and handle the conversation with the person on the other end. You remain in control at all times with a live transcript view and the ability to take over the conversation at any point.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Instead of dialing yourself, just tell Gemini to call on your behalf using the Gemini app on your Pixel.","zh":null},{"en":"Gemini will call the business, introduce itself, navigate automated phone menus, wait on hold, and handle the conversation with the person on the other end.","zh":null},{"en":"You remain in control at all times with a live transcript view and the ability to take over the conversation at any point.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><cite>Image: Google</cite></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Image: Google","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Google announced a similar <a href=\"/ai-artificial-intelligence/830450/ai-shopping-assistants-are-stuck-in-the-past\">“Call for me” feature</a> last year that has its AI call local businesses to ask if they have a product you’re looking for, but it didn’t have an option for users to take over those phone calls. Meta is also working on a similar automated phone call feature for its <a href=\"/ai-artificial-intelligence/999526/meta-muse-ai-agent-hands-on-shopping\">Muse AI agent</a>, although those calls <a href=\"https://www.404media.co/meta-tests-muse-ai-agent-calls-that-are-actually-made-by-humans-in-a-call-center/\">reportedly</a> might be made by a human behind the scenes. Google’s new AI calling feature is rolling out starting today as an “early preview” for “Gemini paid subscribers enrolled in the Phone by Google Public Beta on Pixel 11 in the US.”</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Google announced a similar “Call for me” feature last year that has its AI call local businesses to ask if they have a product you’re looking for, but it didn’t have an option for users to take over those phone calls.","zh":null},{"en":"Meta is also working on a similar automated phone call feature for its Muse AI agent, although those calls reportedly might be made by a human behind the scenes.","zh":null},{"en":"Google’s new AI calling feature is rolling out starting today as an “early preview” for “Gemini paid subscribers enrolled in the Phone by Google Public Beta on Pixel 11 in the US.”","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span><strong>Follow topics and authors</strong> from this story to see more like this in your personalized homepage feed and to receive email updates.</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Follow topics and authors from this story to see more like this in your personalized homepage feed and to receive email updates.","zh":"关注此故事中的主题和作者，以在您的个性化主页源中查看更多类似内容并接收电子邮件更新。"}]},{"html_en":"<li id=\"follow-author-article_footer-dmcyOmF1dGhvclByb2ZpbGU6ODAzMzIw\"><span aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span><span><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 9 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Follow\"><path d=\"M5 0H4V4H0V5H4V9H5V5H9V4H5V0Z\" /></svg></span><span>Stevie Bonifield</span></span></span></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Stevie Bonifield","zh":"史蒂维·博尼菲尔德"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>The Verge Daily</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"The Verge Daily","zh":"边缘日报"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>A free daily digest of the news that matters most.</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"A free daily digest of the news that matters most.","zh":"最重要新闻的免费每日摘要。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><label for=\"email\">Email (required)</label></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Email (required)","zh":"电子邮件（必填）"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"__next\"><p>跳至主要内容</p><nav id=\"sticky-nav\" aria-label=\"Sticky Nav\"></nav><div><main id=\"content\"><div><article><div><div><p>Google’s AI can handle entire phone calls with businesses with a new Pixel 11 feature.</p></div><div><div><p>Google’s AI can handle entire phone calls with businesses with a new Pixel 11 feature.</p><div><p>作者：史蒂维·博尼菲尔德</p><p>Sep 24, 2026, 4:04 PM UTC</p></div></div><div><div><p><img alt=\"Google Pixel 11 Pro Photos of Phone Using On Ear\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 700px\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/Google-Pixel-11-Pro-Photos-of-Phone-Using-On-Ear.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C0.0027950136955752%2C100%2C99.994409972609&w=376 376w, https